# promise: #694
# The toolbar's buttons and address show their hover on the bar they're on: black 6 % on a light
# bar (a white one, or a light page's), where Cra's white hover didn't show, and white on a dark
# page's bar as before (10 % under the buttons, 8 % under the address).
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": true}
cra://open?url=${ORIGIN}/toolbar-colour.html
wait 4
cra://debug?toolbarHover=light
expect-log toolbar hover light: bar=F6F8FA hover=black 6% url=black 6%$
